 "remarks": "Public Remarks Brand new rental construction in Norwalk. Apartment #5035 is a 3 bedroom, 2.5 bath with 1755 square feet. Consists of a spacious kitchen with stainless steel appliances, large island combined with an open floor plan looking out onto the living room. Even has a den you can use as an office, art studio or whatever your passion is. Indoor washer/druer in your apartment. Central Air so much natural light. Amenities in the building are numerous from a fitness room, rooftop patio with grills as well as grills by the outdoor pool, community dining room, wine room, pet spa and indoor dog run and so much more that I did not even mention. This complex is a must see in person to fully realize what this building offers.",
